    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35156" root="قتر" body-key="q">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتتر</span></b> , (Msb,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقتتر فِى قُتْرَةٍ</span>, (A, L, TA,)
in the K, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيهَا</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْتَرَ</span></b> , but this is a mistake, (TA,)
<i>He concealed,</i> or <i>hid, himself in a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُتْرَة</span>. (A, L,
Msb, TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِلصَّيْدِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تقتّر</span></b>  <i>He hid himself in a</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قُتْرَة</span> <i>to deceive the wild animals,</i> or <i>game.</i> (TA.)

